msgid "Now playing shows the Artist Slideshow add-on pictures of the artist (needs script.artistslideshow)."
msgstr "„Läuft gerade“ zeigt die Interpretenbilder des Add-ons Artist Slideshow (braucht script.artistslideshow)."

